   Additional terms, under section 7 of the licence:

   (b) A modified version must keep the attribution "History Globe by Vadym Arnaut",
       with a link to https://historyglobe.app, in the notice or "about" information it
       shows its users (in the original: the Author and Build pages of the Help).
